        "subject": "LU-20723 tests: regroup subtests skipped in 1-client sessions",
        "message": "LU-20723 tests: regroup subtests skipped in 1-client sessions\n\nMost review test sessions are moving to a single client VM, with\nthe tests that need a second client grouped into a few two-client\nsessions.  Five subtests in the single-client sessions skip without\na second client.\n\nMove the three that need a second node to suites that keep two\nclients:\n- replay-single test_70a to replay-dual test_200\n- sanity test_160v to replay-dual test_201\n- replay-single test_200 to recovery-small test_200, and update the\n  \"DO NOT MODIFY\" note in ptlrpc_expire_one_request()\n\nRun the other two on one node:\n- sanityn test_33b runs createmany on $CLIENT1 only\n- replay-vbr test_10b uses $MOUNT3 for its third client\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nTest-Parameters: clientcount=1 mdscount=2 mdtcount=4 testlist=sanityn env=ONLY=33b\nTest-Parameters: clientcount=1 mdscount=2 mdtcount=4 testlist=replay-vbr env=ONLY=10b\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:Opus-5.5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nSigned-off-by: Marc Vef <mvef@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: Ic1db87ab68ff45e81af569a57592e0cdb298cb71\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
